<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Accuracy</title>
    <style>
        h3 { ${REGULAR_LARGE_FONT_STYLE} }
        body { ${REGULAR_FONT_STYLE} }
        code { ${MONOSPACE_FONT_STYLE} }
        h3 code { font-size: inherit; }
        p { margin-top: 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h3>Accuracy</h3>
    <p>How often the model is right. 90% means it got 9 out of 10 test rows correct.</p>
    <p>Watch out: if 95% of your rows are the same class, a model that always guesses that class scores 95% without learning anything. Check the other numbers too.</p>
</body>
</html>
